<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-1269] ignite-hadoop assembly needs to include ignite-indexing </title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-1269</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;ignite-hadoop accelerator was complemented with spark accelerator. However, the latter can not so SQL queries against Ignite cache if Ignite&apos;s indexing layer isn&apos;t present. Let&apos;s include indexing as a dependency to ignite-hadoop. Potentially ignite-spark needs to be added as well.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This issue is observed in release 1.3, but there&apos;s no such version in the JIRA. Why and how it got released without proper JIRA version?&lt;/p&gt;</description>
