                            <comment id="14705137" author="iveselovskiy" created="Thu, 20 Aug 2015 15:36:59 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Konstantin, can you please suggest, what is the simplest scenario to check the suggested fix.&lt;br/&gt;
As I understand, we should assemble BigTop package, set it up, then what Spark task we should run?&lt;br/&gt;
